# Tumbleweeds Volleyball Club WordPress theme

Built the way Chez Koop builds the mode40 theme (see `CHEZ-KOOP-CONVENTIONS.md` at the theme root for the research and the checklist). Use this as the working reference for PHP templates, ACF flexible content, SCSS, and front-end JavaScript.

## Source layout

- **Styles:** `src/scss/app.scss` (compiled to `assets/css/app.min.css` + map). Partials: `base/_variables.scss`, `base/_mixins.scss`, `base/_fonts.scss`, `base/_animations.scss`, `vendor/_reset.scss`, `vendor/_bootstrap.scss` (container only). `editor-style.scss` styles the Classic Editor.
- **Build:** `npm run build` (gulp: sass, webpack, img). `src/js/entry.js` -> `dist/js/app.bundle.js`. **Compiled files are committed.** Never edit `assets/css` or `dist/js` by hand.
- **Flex sections:** `template-parts/content-flexcontent.php` (loop over ACF field `flex_content`). Hero: `template-parts/content-hero.php`.
- **Helpers:** `inc/lib/flex.php` (section helpers), `inc/lib/extras.php` (images, text, buttons, body classes), `inc/lib/acf.php` (options page, option getters), `inc/lib/setup.php` (menus, image sizes, TGMPA, assets), `inc/lib/cpt.php` (Coach), `inc/lib/query-args.php`.
- **ACF JSON:** `acf-json/` is generated by `python3 tools/build_acf_json.py`. Edit the field set in that script and rerun. Seed copy: `python3 tools/build_seed.py` writes `seed/content.json`; `seed/import.php` loads it.

## Tokens (`:root` in app.scss, `01. Base`)

- Colours: `--global--color-<name>` plus opacity steps `-88 -82 -66 ...` from `global-color-with-opacities`. Names: `pine-900/700/500`, `sage-300/100`, `bark-700`, `sun-500/400/100`, `sand-100/200`, `paper-50`, `white`. `--global--color-primary`, `--global--color-background`, `--global--color-line`.
- Type: `--global--font-size-<step>` with paired `--global--line-height-<step>`; use `@include text(step)`. Steps: `2xs xs xs-sm sm sm-md meta md md-lg lg-sm base prose lg h4 lead faq xl pager menu h3 num h2 age hero-page hero display helpline ticker`. Letter spacing: `--global--letter-spacing-*`.
- Space: `--space-4 ... --space-192`. Radius: `--global--border-radius-xs/sm/md/lg/xl/pill`. Layout: `--frame`, `--container-inner`, `--container-padding`, `--inset`, `--section-padding`, `--surface-pad-x`, `--hero-pad-x`. Component measures: `--btn-h`, `--pill-h`, `--header-h`, ...
- Breakpoint overrides of tokens live inside `:root` (large 1280, nav 1180, tablet 1024, phone 860, wide 1441).
- **A literal px in a block means a token is missing.** Add the token, do not add the number.

## HTML and BEM

- **Sections:** one root class per flex layout: `ticker`, `cards`, `strip`, `people`, `statement`, `events`, `faq`, `cta` (`cta--banner`, `cta--highlight`), `facts`, `ages`, `helpline`, `contact`, `news`, `band` (`band--tall`). Rounded paper sections also carry `surface` (`surface--sage|sun|sand`).
- **Elements:** `block__element` (`card__title`, `faq__question`). **Modifiers:** `block--modifier`.
- **Shared:** `.container-2xl` (main width), `.content` (rich text), `.meta` + `.section__eyebrow/__heading/__subhead`, `.surface__head`, `.fact-list > .fact`, `.btn`, `.btn--dark|light|sun|ghost|outline|sm`, `.link`, `.tag--soon`, `.accent` (italic words).
- **State:** `html.js`, `html.scrolled`, `html.menu-open`, `last-module`, `has-announcement`, `has-band`, `.fade-up` (GSAP reveal, CSS pre-state under `html.js`).

## ACF `flex_content` layouts

`section_ticker`, `section_cards`, `section_strip`, `section_people`, `section_statement`, `section_events`, `section_faq`, `section_cta`, `section_facts`, `section_ages`, `section_helpline`, `section_contact`, `section_news`, `section_band`. Common sub-fields: `section_anchor`, `section_eyebrow`, `show_number`, `section_heading`, `section_heading_accent`, `section_lede`, `section_side*`, `section_bg_color`.

Site-wide fields are on the Club settings options page (group "Club Settings"): top bar, info session, scrolling strip, badge, contact and social, helpline, footer. Read them with `tvbc_opt('name')`. The info session rows auto-hide after the date (`tvbc_info_session()`).

## Conventions for new flex layouts

1. Add the layout in `tools/build_acf_json.py` (rerun it) and a branch in `content-flexcontent.php` with `get_row_layout() == 'section_*'`.
2. Single root BEM block named after the layout. Reuse `section_head()` / `section_meta()`, `section_id($i)`, `is_last_row($i,$total_rows)`, `tvbc_btn()`, `tvbc_facts()`, `section_image()`.
3. Fields are editor-proof: choice first (Kind or Style), conditional boxes for what the choice uses, plain labels, one line of instruction on every field, no syntax typed into text boxes.
4. Style in `app.scss` with tokens and `@include text()`. Verify in the browser at 1440 and 390, and check the wp-admin edit screen.

## Words and facts

No em dashes anywhere. The club is "Tumbleweeds Volleyball Club" (never abbreviated in copy, "Tumbleweeds" is fine in the logo). The award is always "2024 U Sports Men's Volleyball Coach of the Year". No TRU or WolfPack logos. Unconfirmed facts show a status tag (Coming soon), never an invented number. `BUILD-BRIEF.md` in the project folder is binding.
